OL,3,GNEWSATommy Robinson hired detectives to
OL,4,Afind journalists, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolitical activist Tommy Robinson has
OL,7,Ftold a court he hired private
OL,8,Fdetectives to track down and photograph
OL,9,Ftwo reporters to "put pressure" on
OL,10,Fthem.
OL,12,FThe 43-year-old from Bedfordshire, real
OL,13,Fname Stephen Yaxley-Lennon, told
OL,14,FSouthwark Crown Court he was "shocked
OL,15,Fand scared" when the Daily Mail
OL,16,Fpublished a story accusing him of
OL,17,F"stoking race riots from his sunbed".
OL,19,FHe has denied two charges of harassment
OL,20,Fcausing fear of violence to reporters
OL,21,FAndrew Young and Jacob Dirnhuber after
OL,22,Fthe 2024 Southport attacks.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
